  "contentHtml": "<div>\r\n<div style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(254,222,199); PADDING-LEFT: 10px; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; BORDER-TOP: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-TOP: 10px\" class=\"txc-textbox\">\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25.6px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2px\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/254A5C3C561B35C03C\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"완성사진_천구만들기.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"956\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"956\" id=\"A_254A5C3C561B35C03CC4F0\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25.6px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2px\"><iframe id=\"ve5e5sasz5eQXyG5GacQcnG\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/ve5e5sasz5eQXyG5GacQcnG?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZlNWU1c2FzejVlUVh5RzVHYWNRY25HIiwidGlkIjoiY2U2YzYwYjAtZWIwOS00MTFkLWE3ZDEtZWVkZjRjZjNmOTI4IiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg1NDk0fQ.-hdnfjZyHZgS9HWCHW1zL5m1tCekLnXRpMvtrw-5mlRJv3L_qw99GuQKeX8hO9xOrZzqPo-mhbU4-GMmfLLUoA&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25.6px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25.6px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2px\"><b><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6; FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/21635A495616DCC834\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"천구만들기1.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\" id=\"A_21635A495616DCC834A9C0\"></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/256381495616DCCB34\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"천구만들기2.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\" id=\"A_256381495616DCCB349955\"></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24615F495616DCCD36\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"천구만들기3.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\" id=\"A_24615F495616DCCD364273\"></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>저도 게시물을 올리는 기회가 생겼어요!^^</p>\r\n<p>천구 만들기 - 방위각, 고도 중심으로 만들어 봤습니다. </p>\r\n<p>관찰자, 고도표시된 것을 빨대에 끼워서 구멍을 뚫어 회전하게 하니까 더 좋더라구요.</p>\r\n<p>투명반구&nbsp;10CM*5CM</p>\r\n<p><br><a href=\"http://astro.kasi.re.kr/Life/SolarHeightForm.aspx?MenuID=108\">http://astro.kasi.re.kr/Life/SolarHeightForm.aspx?MenuID=108</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>해당 사이트에서 태양의 방위각, 고도 확인할 수 있습니다. </p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1313%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20151007150149&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile262.uf.daum.net%2Fimage%2F265F71355614B4BD0E5BC1')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_jpg_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 관측자1.jpg</a><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafe_image/cf_img2/bbs2/btn_imageview.gif' alt='첨부이미지 미리보기' onclick='albumViewer(\"viewer\", \"http://cfile262.uf.daum.net/image/265F71355614B4BD0E5BC1\");' class='attachedImgView' /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1313%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20151007150149&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile248.uf.daum.net%2Fimage%2F253BFB355614B4BF24FA90')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_png_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 받침_방위각.png</a><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafe_image/cf_img2/bbs2/btn_imageview.gif' alt='첨부이미지 미리보기' onclick='albumViewer(\"viewer\", \"http://cfile248.uf.daum.net/image/253BFB355614B4BF24FA90\");' class='attachedImgView' /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1313%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20151007150149&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile272.uf.daum.net%2Fimage%2F2239D3355614B4C0264A3C')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_jpg_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 세우기_고도1.jpg</a><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafe_image/cf_img2/bbs2/btn_imageview.gif' alt='첨부이미지 미리보기' onclick='albumViewer(\"viewer\", \"http://cfile272.uf.daum.net/image/2239D3355614B4C0264A3C\");' class='attachedImgView' /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1313%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20151007150149&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile249.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F263018355614B4C12BB5CA')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 천구만들기_받침.hwp</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p></div>\r\n<p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
